(2745989, 382906, 57712, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and it does look like a magical place. The people in the bottom left really adds tot he shot. Only thing is it looks a little flat and dull on my monitor, like it needs more contrast.</td>', 'I like the composition and it does look like a magical place. The people in the bottom left really adds tot he shot. Only thing is it looks a little flat and dull on my monitor, like it needs more contrast.', '2006-08-21 12:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
