(2746001, 382972, 57712, '<td valign="top">Looks a little grey on my screen. Looks like it could do with some more contrast to give it some more drama as befitting the title.</td>', 'Looks a little grey on my screen. Looks like it could do with some more contrast to give it some more drama as befitting the title.', '2006-08-21 12:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2746008, 382798, 57712, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little flat and low. I know dark usually means mysterious but having an additional light just on her face or something to brighten it up and give more of a focal point may have helped bring some more drama to the shot. Also the shadow is a little distracting.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little flat and low. I know dark usually means mysterious but having an additional light just on her face or something to brighten it up and give more of a focal point may have helped bring some more drama to the shot. Also the shadow is a little distracting.', '2006-08-21 12:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
