(2746152, 382783, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like this very much!   You did a great job with those ghostly people.  And the beautiful night skyline just adds to the beauty of this photo.</td>', 'I like this very much!   You did a great job with those ghostly people.  And the beautiful night skyline just adds to the beauty of this photo.', '2006-08-21 14:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
