(2748777, 383053, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The two shadows don''t quite line up in their rotation, but I''ll forgive you that. 6</td>', 'Nice idea.  The two shadows don''t quite line up in their rotation, but I''ll forgive you that. 6', '2006-08-22 12:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748779, 383049, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the levitating shots I''ve seen.  This is a bit too saturated which makes the model''s hands look blurred (could be some mild motion blur if it''s a long exp too since it would be hard to hold them still). I might have cloned out the zipper lines. 5</td>', 'I like the levitating shots I''ve seen.  This is a bit too saturated which makes the model''s hands look blurred (could be some mild motion blur if it''s a long exp too since it would be hard to hold them still). I might have cloned out the zipper lines. 5', '2006-08-22 12:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748781, 382967, 40718, '<td valign="top">You know, I can''t quite tell what this is (stick or rope in the water) and it doesn''t really invoke Magic &amp; Mystery to me, but I do like the abstract colors from processing.  I''m gonna give you a 6 for that quality.</td>', 'You know, I can''t quite tell what this is (stick or rope in the water) and it doesn''t really invoke Magic & Mystery to me, but I do like the abstract colors from processing.  I''m gonna give you a 6 for that quality.', '2006-08-22 12:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748786, 382990, 40718, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t quite click for me.  Is it the mystery of what a Christian looks like?  (Apparently either like Jonny Cash or the neighbor from Home Improvement. :))  I''m gonna have to go with a 3 on this one.  Sorry.</td>', 'This one doesn''t quite click for me.  Is it the mystery of what a Christian looks like?  (Apparently either like Jonny Cash or the neighbor from Home Improvement. :))  I''m gonna have to go with a 3 on this one.  Sorry.', '2006-08-22 12:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748790, 383005, 40718, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, I miss those butterflies.  Haven''t seen them here in WA.  I think they were a dimorphic species of swallowtail?  Anyway, the blur, or NI, or whatever of the background does give a nice fantasy feel.  Nice processing.  I''m actually not quite sure what the big brown thing is.  I thought a leaf, but I''m not sure.  Gonna go with 6.  Just a tad oversharp on the butterfly.</td>', 'Mmmm, I miss those butterflies.  Haven''t seen them here in WA.  I think they were a dimorphic species of swallowtail?  Anyway, the blur, or NI, or whatever of the background does give a nice fantasy feel.  Nice processing.  I''m actually not quite sure what the big brown thing is.  I thought a leaf, but I''m not sure.  Gonna go with 6.  Just a tad oversharp on the butterfly.', '2006-08-22 12:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748794, 383044, 40718, '<td valign="top">To me the exposure or processing is off a tad.  The surf looks too gray to my eyes.  Composition is nice.  I''m afraid one point off for relying on the title. 5.</td>', 'To me the exposure or processing is off a tad.  The surf looks too gray to my eyes.  Composition is nice.  I''m afraid one point off for relying on the title. 5.', '2006-08-22 13:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748795, 382902, 40718, '<td valign="top">Super-processing doesn''t fly on DPC.  I like some of it, but not this one.  It''s mainly the halos around the red and the super white of the eyes. 3.</td>', 'Super-processing doesn''t fly on DPC.  I like some of it, but not this one.  It''s mainly the halos around the red and the super white of the eyes. 3.', '2006-08-22 13:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748799, 382865, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nicely done with the exotic feel.  I think you added the tint in PP and I''m not quite sure about it, but it isn''t bad.  A total nitpick, but I think I may have cloned out the structure on the far right, but I generally don''t like buildings in my landscapes. 8</td>', 'Nicely done with the exotic feel.  I think you added the tint in PP and I''m not quite sure about it, but it isn''t bad.  A total nitpick, but I think I may have cloned out the structure on the far right, but I generally don''t like buildings in my landscapes. 8', '2006-08-22 13:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748801, 382748, 40718, '<td valign="top">Pretty odd. ;)  Would have done nicely to have a more complementary color in the background?  This adds too much saturation to the pepper and degrades the image somewhat. 4</td>', 'Pretty odd. ;)  Would have done nicely to have a more complementary color in the background?  This adds too much saturation to the pepper and degrades the image somewhat. 4', '2006-08-22 13:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748802, 382589, 40718, '<td valign="top">Clever.  Your border really got hosed in your PP.  Personally, when I have a subject OOF, I don''t like it to be nearly blown.  The DOF is good, but the lighting isn''t.  I wonder what it would have looked like to light the gloved hands from below? (Maybe worse) 5</td>', 'Clever.  Your border really got hosed in your PP.  Personally, when I have a subject OOF, I don''t like it to be nearly blown.  The DOF is good, but the lighting isn''t.  I wonder what it would have looked like to light the gloved hands from below? (Maybe worse) 5', '2006-08-22 13:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748804, 382798, 40718, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but I think in the end just a bit too dark.  The colors are also tending to a muddy brown instead of black.  Not sure about that.  A simple thing (and I''m docking you for this) would have been to clone that hot pixel out. 5</td>', 'Not bad, but I think in the end just a bit too dark.  The colors are also tending to a muddy brown instead of black.  Not sure about that.  A simple thing (and I''m docking you for this) would have been to clone that hot pixel out. 5', '2006-08-22 13:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748811, 382557, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love the way the lighting on this makes the little points look lit up like stars.  I think you did a great job on this.   I''ve always loved photos of these wispy little plants :)</td>', 'I love the way the lighting on this makes the little points look lit up like stars.  I think you did a great job on this.   I''ve always loved photos of these wispy little plants :)', '2006-08-22 13:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748817, 382930, 24454, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  Kind of Abstract and "Lord of the Rings"ish :)</td>', 'Nice job.  Kind of Abstract and "Lord of the Rings"ish :)', '2006-08-22 13:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748821, 382378, 24454, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s one haunted house I would be happy to live in :)  Beautiful grounds, processed very well to enhance the lush look.</td>', 'Now, that''s one haunted house I would be happy to live in :)  Beautiful grounds, processed very well to enhance the lush look.', '2006-08-22 13:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748827, 381101, 40718, '<td valign="top">Great captured sunset/sunrise.  Mildly DNMC, but not a biggie.  Perhaps a tiny bit more sharpening on the upper clouds (but I love a sharp image). 6</td>', 'Great captured sunset/sunrise.  Mildly DNMC, but not a biggie.  Perhaps a tiny bit more sharpening on the upper clouds (but I love a sharp image). 6', '2006-08-22 13:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748832, 382906, 57229, '<td valign="top">Très bien avec les promeneurs - bien composé. (Plus de mystère, mais toujours bien le magi).</td>', 'Très bien avec les promeneurs - bien composé. (Plus de mystère, mais toujours bien le magi).', '2006-08-22 13:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748833, 382465, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hmm, the exotic look is good.  The blown sky and relatively low contrast of the background isn''t.  Doesn''t invoke a great amount of M&amp;M to me, but I wouldn''t call it DNMC. 5.</td>', 'Hmm, the exotic look is good.  The blown sky and relatively low contrast of the background isn''t.  Doesn''t invoke a great amount of M&M to me, but I wouldn''t call it DNMC. 5.', '2006-08-22 13:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748835, 382801, 40718, '<td valign="top">haha, that''s pretty funny.  Extra point for the self-aware humor.  Composition is nice.  The noise?  I could take it or leave it. 6</td>', 'haha, that''s pretty funny.  Extra point for the self-aware humor.  Composition is nice.  The noise?  I could take it or leave it. 6', '2006-08-22 13:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748838, 382830, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice exotic feel.  Lighting is nice.  PP with the halo isn''t. 6</td>', 'Nice exotic feel.  Lighting is nice.  PP with the halo isn''t. 6', '2006-08-22 13:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748839, 383008, 40718, '<td valign="top">Overexposed on the sky and I would have waited (or taken more shots) looking for lightning with a better composition.  The clouds are pretty cool though. 4</td>', 'Overexposed on the sky and I would have waited (or taken more shots) looking for lightning with a better composition.  The clouds are pretty cool though. 4', '2006-08-22 13:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748840, 382833, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nicely exotic.  B&amp;W conversion isn''t bad.  Might have been a tough exposure, but maybe a bit too bright on the skin (esp around the eye).  Composition and framing is nice. 7</td>', 'Nicely exotic.  B&W conversion isn''t bad.  Might have been a tough exposure, but maybe a bit too bright on the skin (esp around the eye).  Composition and framing is nice. 7', '2006-08-22 13:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748842, 382878, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice feel.  The trees in the background do scream "print" to me.  Just a tad too centered, but I love the capture of the smoke. 7</td>', 'Nice feel.  The trees in the background do scream "print" to me.  Just a tad too centered, but I love the capture of the smoke. 7', '2006-08-22 13:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748851, 383007, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like it.  Well composed and the trick is pulled off well. 8</td>', 'Nice.  I like it.  Well composed and the trick is pulled off well. 8', '2006-08-22 13:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
