(2749279, 382950, 63104, '<td valign="top">wow ... beautiful model, fantastically sharp capture and the ear is just classic. Even without that touch, I think the model''s expression is bewitching and mysterious enough to meet the challenge criteria. This is a 10 from me, and I don''t think I will be the only one giving you the top score. Again, excellent shot.</td>', 'wow ... beautiful model, fantastically sharp capture and the ear is just classic. Even without that touch, I think the model''s expression is bewitching and mysterious enough to meet the challenge criteria. This is a 10 from me, and I don''t think I will be the only one giving you the top score. Again, excellent shot.', '2006-08-22 16:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
