(2749743, 382127, 40718, '<td valign="top">Make that canvas bigger.  We always want 640 pixels on one side.  The shot could benefit from some PP.  Shadow/highlights or hue masked to the clouds.  A vertical orientation may help and I wish I had something in the foreground (beach, boat, bird, something). Perhaps I''m thinking too much of my Afterlife shot.  Mildly DNMC (not enough to vote down). 4</td>', 'Make that canvas bigger.  We always want 640 pixels on one side.  The shot could benefit from some PP.  Shadow/highlights or hue masked to the clouds.  A vertical orientation may help and I wish I had something in the foreground (beach, boat, bird, something). Perhaps I''m thinking too much of my Afterlife shot.  Mildly DNMC (not enough to vote down). 4', '2006-08-22 19:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2749744, 382734, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape.  Nice conversion from B&amp;W.  Doesn''t speak a great deal of M&amp;M to me, but the rock formations are slightly exotic. 5</td>', 'Nice landscape.  Nice conversion from B&W.  Doesn''t speak a great deal of M&M to me, but the rock formations are slightly exotic. 5', '2006-08-22 19:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2749746, 382874, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think this may qualify as "bad bokeh" (if you even paid attention to that thread back on that challenge).  Look at the way the highlights stand out on parts of the ducks.  Not too pleasant.  The absolute centered subject is a bit tough too.  Doesn''t speak M&amp;M to me. 4</td>', 'I think this may qualify as "bad bokeh" (if you even paid attention to that thread back on that challenge).  Look at the way the highlights stand out on parts of the ducks.  Not too pleasant.  The absolute centered subject is a bit tough too.  Doesn''t speak M&M to me. 4', '2006-08-22 19:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2749749, 382903, 40718, '<td valign="top">Get that canvas up to 640px my man!  Sigh.  I''m a real sucker for a good IR shot.  Maybe because I haven''t done any myself yet.  One point off for canvas size. 7</td>', 'Get that canvas up to 640px my man!  Sigh.  I''m a real sucker for a good IR shot.  Maybe because I haven''t done any myself yet.  One point off for canvas size. 7', '2006-08-22 19:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
