(2752461, 382950, 31905, '<td valign="top">Love the look in her eyes. Excellent shot.</td>', 'Love the look in her eyes. Excellent shot.', '2006-08-23 12:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752526, 382872, 62903, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of playfulness coming from the rabbit''s eyes. Like the color and texture.</td>', 'Love the sense of playfulness coming from the rabbit''s eyes. Like the color and texture.', '2006-08-23 12:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752556, 382636, 5885, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, well done!</td>', 'Very nice shot, well done!', '2006-08-23 13:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752576, 382971, 64061, '<td valign="top">This pooch spooked me as soon as I saw the thumbnail. Any reason one eye is blurred?</td>', 'This pooch spooked me as soon as I saw the thumbnail. Any reason one eye is blurred?', '2006-08-23 13:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752584, 382992, 64061, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice structure but somehow the color is a little flat...not terribly mysterious IMHO.</td>', 'It''s a nice structure but somehow the color is a little flat...not terribly mysterious IMHO.', '2006-08-23 13:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752593, 382745, 64061, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute plant but I''m not sure I''d call it mysterious...I''m also having trouble finding any part of the picture that''s completely focused...</td>', 'It''s a cute plant but I''m not sure I''d call it mysterious...I''m also having trouble finding any part of the picture that''s completely focused...', '2006-08-23 13:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752601, 381340, 64061, '<td valign="top">A bit of motion blur which I have a hard time with after seeing some of the top entries in the Fireworks challenge.</td>', 'A bit of motion blur which I have a hard time with after seeing some of the top entries in the Fireworks challenge.', '2006-08-23 13:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752608, 381722, 64061, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is, maybe the lighting, but this looks more like a girl with paint on her face than something magical or mysterious.</td>', 'Not sure what it is, maybe the lighting, but this looks more like a girl with paint on her face than something magical or mysterious.', '2006-08-23 13:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752617, 381952, 64061, '<td valign="top">Somehow the difference in lighting on the pencil and girl (even the hand) make this seem less convincing to me. Even if it''s magic, I it should be convincingly real.</td>', 'Somehow the difference in lighting on the pencil and girl (even the hand) make this seem less convincing to me. Even if it''s magic, I it should be convincingly real.', '2006-08-23 13:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752625, 382748, 64061, '<td valign="top">Nice. It''s very crisp and for some reason it bothers me (in a good way).</td>', 'Nice. It''s very crisp and for some reason it bothers me (in a good way).', '2006-08-23 13:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752634, 382798, 64061, '<td valign="top">Looks more like some paintings I''ve seen than a photograph which I consider a good thing in this case. I get a nice vibe from this but what''s up with the hot pixels?</td>', 'Looks more like some paintings I''ve seen than a photograph which I consider a good thing in this case. I get a nice vibe from this but what''s up with the hot pixels?', '2006-08-23 13:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752641, 382986, 64061, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, especially the choice of color. Crystal balls make good photographic subjects, don''t they.</td>', 'I really like this one, especially the choice of color. Crystal balls make good photographic subjects, don''t they.', '2006-08-23 13:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752648, 383048, 64061, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a lovely choice of colors. Makes me want to get that lipstick for my girlfriend. The eye color and lip/mask color were carefully chosen to match the feathers. Nice job.</td>', 'Wow, what a lovely choice of colors. Makes me want to get that lipstick for my girlfriend. The eye color and lip/mask color were carefully chosen to match the feathers. Nice job.', '2006-08-23 13:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752652, 382581, 64061, '<td valign="top">I guess it''s not clear that having the entire image blurred helps here...</td>', 'I guess it''s not clear that having the entire image blurred helps here...', '2006-08-23 13:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752663, 382807, 64061, '<td valign="top">I guess I''d prefer if the bulb weren''t solid white, i.e. overexposed. It does stand out against the solid black background but I think seeing the filament or at least the soft glow of a frosted bulb would perhaps be nicer.</td>', 'I guess I''d prefer if the bulb weren''t solid white, i.e. overexposed. It does stand out against the solid black background but I think seeing the filament or at least the soft glow of a frosted bulb would perhaps be nicer.', '2006-08-23 13:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752667, 382431, 64061, '<td valign="top">Whoa, this place is strange enough to count as mysterious in my book...</td>', 'Whoa, this place is strange enough to count as mysterious in my book...', '2006-08-23 13:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752673, 382127, 64061, '<td valign="top">I guess the title is a minor turn-off for me and I can imagine a more flattering version of this same genre of photo. God''s Creation is a little too brownish for me here.</td>', 'I guess the title is a minor turn-off for me and I can imagine a more flattering version of this same genre of photo. God''s Creation is a little too brownish for me here.', '2006-08-23 13:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752685, 381543, 64061, '<td valign="top">Holy crap, if the challenge category were "Scary" you''d have won for sure. But this certainly counts as mysterious if you know that guy is lurking in the darkness. Nice.</td>', 'Holy crap, if the challenge category were "Scary" you''d have won for sure. But this certainly counts as mysterious if you know that guy is lurking in the darkness. Nice.', '2006-08-23 13:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752692, 383052, 64061, '<td valign="top">Very convincing magic here. The lighting of the book-holding girl matches the rest of the scene so it looks real.</td>', 'Very convincing magic here. The lighting of the book-holding girl matches the rest of the scene so it looks real.', '2006-08-23 13:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752699, 382878, 64061, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect. I like the puff of smoke coming from the eye socket.</td>', 'Very nice effect. I like the puff of smoke coming from the eye socket.', '2006-08-23 13:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752713, 382378, 64061, '<td valign="top">The house has potential but the weather doesn''t give me that feeling. You might be alluding to what happens after the sun goes down, but if that''s the case I think you''re alluding too much. I''m not a huge fan of the gradient border.</td>', 'The house has potential but the weather doesn''t give me that feeling. You might be alluding to what happens after the sun goes down, but if that''s the case I think you''re alluding too much. I''m not a huge fan of the gradient border.', '2006-08-23 13:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752718, 381802, 64061, '<td valign="top">This one has feeling for me. Where''s he going? What''s his plan? Does he see the rain clouds? Nice picture!</td>', 'This one has feeling for me. Where''s he going? What''s his plan? Does he see the rain clouds? Nice picture!', '2006-08-23 13:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752732, 382991, 64061, '<td valign="top">Oh man, grim, but it''s great. Did you stage it or did they really end up like that? It fully deserves to be added it to my favorites but I''m not sure I want to look at it too often! :)</td>', 'Oh man, grim, but it''s great. Did you stage it or did they really end up like that? It fully deserves to be added it to my favorites but I''m not sure I want to look at it too often! :)', '2006-08-23 13:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752755, 383040, 64061, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I have something vaguely like it (shadowy figure with blue cast) that I took years before the competition so I couldn''t enter it but I would have otherwise. But you can be my proxy, you have my vote (or comment, at least)! I guess you had to choose between this challenge and the silhouette challenge on this one...</td>', 'I really like this. I have something vaguely like it (shadowy figure with blue cast) that I took years before the competition so I couldn''t enter it but I would have otherwise. But you can be my proxy, you have my vote (or comment, at least)! I guess you had to choose between this challenge and the silhouette challenge on this one...', '2006-08-23 13:50:57.000000', NULL, 1);
