(2753527, 383052, 60862, '<td valign="top">GREAT concept, great execution on the levitation, and perfect title.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, the rest of the photo is so low-contrast as to be kind of blah, and the floating girl''s face is too washed out. 5</td>', 'GREAT concept, great execution on the levitation, and perfect title. Unfortunately, the rest of the photo is so low-contrast as to be kind of blah, and the floating girl''s face is too washed out. 5', '2006-08-23 17:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
