(2753550, 383046, 40718, '<td valign="top">Most excellent.  Very good double exposure as I''m guessing you made it even more difficult with having to adjust your lens'' focal length.  This should be right up there. 9 for now.  Could bump you at the end.  I expect this one to ribbon (although not to blue...I know which one will do that)</td>', 'Most excellent.  Very good double exposure as I''m guessing you made it even more difficult with having to adjust your lens'' focal length.  This should be right up there. 9 for now.  Could bump you at the end.  I expect this one to ribbon (although not to blue...I know which one will do that)', '2006-08-23 17:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
