(2753578, 382581, 40718, '<td valign="top">d''oh.  That blur isn''t adding much to the shot.  The subject isn''t conveying M&amp;M to me either apart from the title.  Too bad there didn''t just happen to be a guy on a raft with a push pole going by, eh?  Gonna have to hit you with a 3-bomb.</td>', 'd''oh.  That blur isn''t adding much to the shot.  The subject isn''t conveying M&M to me either apart from the title.  Too bad there didn''t just happen to be a guy on a raft with a push pole going by, eh?  Gonna have to hit you with a 3-bomb.', '2006-08-23 17:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
