(2754125, 383042, 40320, '<td valign="top">love the idea.  One of my favs.  I would have given one additional point higher if it was either more of a silhouette or brighter in color.  It appears to be in the middle.  9</td>', 'love the idea.  One of my favs.  I would have given one additional point higher if it was either more of a silhouette or brighter in color.  It appears to be in the middle.  9', '2006-08-23 19:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
