(2754136, 383040, 40320, '<td valign="top">oddly enough, the ponytail gave you an additional point from me. Sort of a type of apparitional innocence I guess. well done with blending the two scenes together.  great job.</td>', 'oddly enough, the ponytail gave you an additional point from me. Sort of a type of apparitional innocence I guess. well done with blending the two scenes together.  great job.', '2006-08-23 19:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754164, 383007, 15768, '<td valign="top">Hey Dan! This is a solid shot. I love how you took the conventional pentagram and turned it 3D... having the circle lay on the floor and the star stand up really makes the shot. To bad the strings didn''t work out, the curviness of the pentagram is a bit distacting. <br/>Your pose is great. the only think i could suggest is using a incandescent filter on your flash so that you match the color of the flame. Whenever playing with fire and flash, you must do that, or else you fail to fool the viewer in thinking that the fire is illuminating you.</td>', 'Hey Dan! This is a solid shot. I love how you took the conventional pentagram and turned it 3D... having the circle lay on the floor and the star stand up really makes the shot. To bad the strings didn''t work out, the curviness of the pentagram is a bit distacting. Your pose is great. the only think i could suggest is using a incandescent filter on your flash so that you match the color of the flame. Whenever playing with fire and flash, you must do that, or else you fail to fool the viewer in thinking that the fire is illuminating you.', '2006-08-23 19:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754169, 382720, 63894, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2006-08-23 19:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754194, 382687, 15540, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. I like the soft illusion to it. Give the girl an oversized frog. =) One that would stand out more in the picture. That would give some "magic" to the picture. <br/> <br/>Have her looking at the frog with anticipation and hope. Her looking up (to whatever it is she sees), doesn''t quite make her WISH come true.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-30 04:27:22.</i></td>', 'Fun shot. I like the soft illusion to it. Give the girl an oversized frog. =) One that would stand out more in the picture. That would give some "magic" to the picture.  Have her looking at the frog with anticipation and hope. Her looking up (to whatever it is she sees), doesn''t quite make her WISH come true.', '2006-08-23 20:10:03.000000', '2006-08-30 05:27:22.000000', 1),
(2754196, 382726, 15540, '<td valign="top">Magic and mystery?</td>', 'Magic and mystery?', '2006-08-23 20:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754200, 381445, 15540, '<td valign="top">Createive idea but doesn''t quite do it.</td>', 'Createive idea but doesn''t quite do it.', '2006-08-23 20:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754243, 382702, 40718, '<td valign="top">The ornamentation of the architecture does give a bit of a mysterious feel, but not a ton.  It''s tough to get right, but learning how to adjust perspective in PS to mimic a tilt-shift lens would be helpful.  I do like the desat feel. 4</td>', 'The ornamentation of the architecture does give a bit of a mysterious feel, but not a ton.  It''s tough to get right, but learning how to adjust perspective in PS to mimic a tilt-shift lens would be helpful.  I do like the desat feel. 4', '2006-08-23 20:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754245, 382971, 40718, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad one eye is in focus while the other isn''t.  I''m guessing a shallow DOF was to blame.  Nice composition though. 5</td>', 'It''s too bad one eye is in focus while the other isn''t.  I''m guessing a shallow DOF was to blame.  Nice composition though. 5', '2006-08-23 20:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754247, 382758, 40718, '<td valign="top">the stick adds something here.  Mildly mysterious, but you can get a sense of how we felt as kids. Maybe a vertical crop would have been better here. 5</td>', 'the stick adds something here.  Mildly mysterious, but you can get a sense of how we felt as kids. Maybe a vertical crop would have been better here. 5', '2006-08-23 20:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754250, 382978, 40718, '<td valign="top">The blue eye is nice, but there isn''t too much else for me to get excited about.  Lighting is flat and the background is distracting (are those people back there?). 4</td>', 'The blue eye is nice, but there isn''t too much else for me to get excited about.  Lighting is flat and the background is distracting (are those people back there?). 4', '2006-08-23 20:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754252, 382940, 40718, '<td valign="top">Trains are sorta mysterious, aren''t they?  I like the predominant sky, but maybe it''s a little too much.  would the landscape handle a bit of a lower crop?  Bringing out the train a bit more in PP could have been nice too. 5</td>', 'Trains are sorta mysterious, aren''t they?  I like the predominant sky, but maybe it''s a little too much.  would the landscape handle a bit of a lower crop?  Bringing out the train a bit more in PP could have been nice too. 5', '2006-08-23 20:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754254, 382858, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nicely spooky gaze.  A bit soft.  The lighting is nice though. I like the understated title. 6</td>', 'Nicely spooky gaze.  A bit soft.  The lighting is nice though. I like the understated title. 6', '2006-08-23 20:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754259, 382906, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hmm, not getting a big M&amp;M feel.  The people sorta ruin it.  Afternoon strolls don''t make me think of magic or mystery.  Perhaps some more dramatic PP to the clouds with a different crop. 4</td>', 'Hmm, not getting a big M&M feel.  The people sorta ruin it.  Afternoon strolls don''t make me think of magic or mystery.  Perhaps some more dramatic PP to the clouds with a different crop. 4', '2006-08-23 20:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754260, 381823, 40718, '<td valign="top">A nice picture.  M&amp;M is mild.  The exposure and lighting and PP is well done though. 6</td>', 'A nice picture.  M&M is mild.  The exposure and lighting and PP is well done though. 6', '2006-08-23 20:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754266, 382972, 40718, '<td valign="top">I could have gone with a slightly better B&amp;W conversion.  I do think the terrain looks Mordorish.  The centered nature of the spire isn''t the best though.  I would have moved it, if possible, to the left and get more of those great clouds over there. 5</td>', 'I could have gone with a slightly better B&W conversion.  I do think the terrain looks Mordorish.  The centered nature of the spire isn''t the best though.  I would have moved it, if possible, to the left and get more of those great clouds over there. 5', '2006-08-23 20:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754268, 382851, 40718, '<td valign="top">Moderate on the M&amp;M feel.  Composition is nice.  Lighting is a bit overexposed, but just a bit. 5</td>', 'Moderate on the M&M feel.  Composition is nice.  Lighting is a bit overexposed, but just a bit. 5', '2006-08-23 20:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754272, 382991, 40718, '<td valign="top">hmm, sorta of a neat M&amp;M subject.  Perhaps some burning around the background would have helped make it pop, but I''m not an expert burner. 5</td>', 'hmm, sorta of a neat M&M subject.  Perhaps some burning around the background would have helped make it pop, but I''m not an expert burner. 5', '2006-08-23 20:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754275, 382804, 40718, '<td valign="top">Would have liked a deeper DOF.  She is much softer than the book and I would have preferred the opposite if you must use a shallow DOF. 5</td>', 'Would have liked a deeper DOF.  She is much softer than the book and I would have preferred the opposite if you must use a shallow DOF. 5', '2006-08-23 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754280, 380848, 40718, '<td valign="top">A neat little trinket.  I like the yellow border.  The centered nature works, I guess, although I would have tried to go off-centered if I could have added a bit more to the composition. 6 on feel and not technicals.</td>', 'A neat little trinket.  I like the yellow border.  The centered nature works, I guess, although I would have tried to go off-centered if I could have added a bit more to the composition. 6 on feel and not technicals.', '2006-08-23 20:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754285, 381856, 40718, '<td valign="top">Dark.  I''m not too much of a fan of shots which require reading to "make" the shot.  This isn''t too bad, but is moving in that direction. 5</td>', 'Dark.  I''m not too much of a fan of shots which require reading to "make" the shot.  This isn''t too bad, but is moving in that direction. 5', '2006-08-23 20:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
