(2754297, 382094, 40718, '<td valign="top">The composition feels a bit squeezed with it being so near the wall.  It''s a nice attempt at a ghost image.  I''d like more to the ambiance of the cottage than just the wood walls. 6</td>', 'The composition feels a bit squeezed with it being so near the wall.  It''s a nice attempt at a ghost image.  I''d like more to the ambiance of the cottage than just the wood walls. 6', '2006-08-23 20:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
