(2755222, 381612, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an eye!  I like the connection to the black cat concept, and the title ties it up in a neat package.  I like the placement of the eye in the image, too.  Bumping from 6 to 7.</td>', 'Wow, what an eye!  I like the connection to the black cat concept, and the title ties it up in a neat package.  I like the placement of the eye in the image, too.  Bumping from 6 to 7.', '2006-08-24 00:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755225, 382970, 60862, '<td valign="top">I assume you wanted it that dim, but in my opinion, that detracts from the photo.  It''s an interesting arrangement, though, with some depth, which is better than just laying it all out flat.  4.</td>', 'I assume you wanted it that dim, but in my opinion, that detracts from the photo.  It''s an interesting arrangement, though, with some depth, which is better than just laying it all out flat.  4.', '2006-08-24 00:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755226, 382880, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here.//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=382880#<br/>&gt;&gt;<br/> <br/>However, this composition doesn''t hold my attention.  I looked right at the people in the middle of the photo first, and then seeing nothing especially interesting or relevant to magic or mystery, I wandered around until I noticed the face in the lower left.<br/> <br/>Maybe if you''d blurred out the people in the middle a bit, and cropped the right third off, it would''ve driven my eye more to the "lost maiden." 4.</td>', 'I like the idea here.//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=382880#>> However, this composition doesn''t hold my attention.  I looked right at the people in the middle of the photo first, and then seeing nothing especially interesting or relevant to magic or mystery, I wandered around until I noticed the face in the lower left. Maybe if you''d blurred out the people in the middle a bit, and cropped the right third off, it would''ve driven my eye more to the "lost maiden." 4.', '2006-08-24 00:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755228, 382876, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I''m not getting a feeling of the tree being magic.  It''s a nice image of an interestingly shaped tree;  I just don''t get the connection to the challenge topic.  Aside from that, I might prefer it to be a bit brighter to bring out the details in the bark.  4.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I''m not getting a feeling of the tree being magic.  It''s a nice image of an interestingly shaped tree;  I just don''t get the connection to the challenge topic.  Aside from that, I might prefer it to be a bit brighter to bring out the details in the bark.  4.', '2006-08-24 00:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755229, 382956, 60862, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t equate juggling and magic.  He may well have done magic at another point, but not here.  It''s a funny picture outside of this challenge, and I like your composition aside from the flag at the top.  And the woman''s face is hilarious!  DNMC but a decent photo otherwise nets a 4 from me.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t equate juggling and magic.  He may well have done magic at another point, but not here.  It''s a funny picture outside of this challenge, and I like your composition aside from the flag at the top.  And the woman''s face is hilarious!  DNMC but a decent photo otherwise nets a 4 from me.', '2006-08-24 00:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755230, 382865, 60862, '<td valign="top">To me, this is a weak connection.  I like the photo to carry the story, and without looking at the title, I see an interesting shot but not much magic or mystery.<br/> <br/>Aside from the challenge, though, the muted colors don''t really catch my eye, and the lack of contrast between the witch doctor and his surroundings make himn harder to spot.  4.</td>', 'To me, this is a weak connection.  I like the photo to carry the story, and without looking at the title, I see an interesting shot but not much magic or mystery. Aside from the challenge, though, the muted colors don''t really catch my eye, and the lack of contrast between the witch doctor and his surroundings make himn harder to spot.  4.', '2006-08-24 00:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755232, 382798, 60862, '<td valign="top">I get the mystery of wondering who she is.  But the picture is so dark as to leave me wanting to see more.  Dodging or otherwise lightening up her face would add a lot.  4.</td>', 'I get the mystery of wondering who she is.  But the picture is so dark as to leave me wanting to see more.  Dodging or otherwise lightening up her face would add a lot.  4.', '2006-08-24 00:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755237, 382830, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I''m not getting either magic or mystery here.  Maybe it would''ve worked better for me if she were becoming a cat (or a human!), or if her eyes glowed.  But this strikes me as a pretty dead-on portrait of someone with face paint. Outside of this challenge, though, it''s a nice enough shot.  4.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I''m not getting either magic or mystery here.  Maybe it would''ve worked better for me if she were becoming a cat (or a human!), or if her eyes glowed.  But this strikes me as a pretty dead-on portrait of someone with face paint. Outside of this challenge, though, it''s a nice enough shot.  4.', '2006-08-24 00:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755238, 382833, 60862, '<td valign="top">This looks to me like a dramatic moment from a play, but the drama seems to be her emotion, not that she''s casting a spell.  Assuming your title reflects what was really going on, then my comment is that the photo doesn''t capture that for me.<br/> <br/>It''s a nice photo otherwise - good composition and lighting, although I might''ve cropped a bit more off the bottom.<br/> <br/>But lacking a connection in the image to the challenge (as opposed to the title), I can''t give it higher than a 4.  So, 4 it is.</td>', 'This looks to me like a dramatic moment from a play, but the drama seems to be her emotion, not that she''s casting a spell.  Assuming your title reflects what was really going on, then my comment is that the photo doesn''t capture that for me. It''s a nice photo otherwise - good composition and lighting, although I might''ve cropped a bit more off the bottom. But lacking a connection in the image to the challenge (as opposed to the title), I can''t give it higher than a 4.  So, 4 it is.', '2006-08-24 00:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755241, 382702, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting building front, but I''m not seeing the connection to magic or mystery.  And even the title isn''t suggesting either one.<br/> <br/>I''d suggest rotating it a bit;  I suspect the window are actually vertical. 4.</td>', 'Interesting building front, but I''m not seeing the connection to magic or mystery.  And even the title isn''t suggesting either one. I''d suggest rotating it a bit;  I suspect the window are actually vertical. 4.', '2006-08-24 00:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755244, 382899, 60862, '<td valign="top">I initially gave this a 4.  I''m bumping it to a 5, but that''s primarily because I''m seeing more of a magic connection on a second viewing.  I''m curious how you got the bright spots all the way down the stairs.  5.</td>', 'I initially gave this a 4.  I''m bumping it to a 5, but that''s primarily because I''m seeing more of a magic connection on a second viewing.  I''m curious how you got the bright spots all the way down the stairs.  5.', '2006-08-24 00:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755254, 382967, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I don''t see what''s magic here.  And there''s not much that catches my eye.  I think it''s just the subject, and the colors.  3.</td>', 'I''m afraid I don''t see what''s magic here.  And there''s not much that catches my eye.  I think it''s just the subject, and the colors.  3.', '2006-08-24 00:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755260, 381802, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the title reflects what you see when you look at this shot, but to me this image isn''t mysterious at all.<br/> <br/>It''s a nice enough photo outside the challenge, although I wonder what enhancing the contrast might do.  4.</td>', 'I''m sure the title reflects what you see when you look at this shot, but to me this image isn''t mysterious at all. It''s a nice enough photo outside the challenge, although I wonder what enhancing the contrast might do.  4.', '2006-08-24 00:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755270, 381543, 60862, '<td valign="top">Is that thing real?  It looks fake to me.<br/> <br/>Aside from that, the dead-center subject, lack of sharp focus, and harsh lighting/shadow all detract.  Trying to think of a suggestion for how you could take this better, I''m wondering what it''d look like with a dimmer overall picture but the eyes lit up with a flashlight.  And no flash or a light source with some tissue or something to diffuse the light.  3.</td>', 'Is that thing real?  It looks fake to me. Aside from that, the dead-center subject, lack of sharp focus, and harsh lighting/shadow all detract.  Trying to think of a suggestion for how you could take this better, I''m wondering what it''d look like with a dimmer overall picture but the eyes lit up with a flashlight.  And no flash or a light source with some tissue or something to diffuse the light.  3.', '2006-08-24 00:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755275, 382726, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty image, although I''d crop the last few blinds off the bottom.<br/> <br/>However, the image says nothing magical or mysterious to me.  That adds up to a 4 from me.</td>', 'This is a pretty image, although I''d crop the last few blinds off the bottom. However, the image says nothing magical or mysterious to me.  That adds up to a 4 from me.', '2006-08-24 00:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755281, 382855, 60862, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this more if it were brighter, to give it a little more context.  I also wonder how it would look taller, with more stars above the northern lights.  4.</td>', 'I think I''d like this more if it were brighter, to give it a little more context.  I also wonder how it would look taller, with more stars above the northern lights.  4.', '2006-08-24 00:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755291, 382251, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting any connection to magic or mystery other than from the title.  It''s also dimly lit.  Sorry, but this doesn''t grab me.  Maybe if the cup were smoking or glowing?  3.</td>', 'I''m not getting any connection to magic or mystery other than from the title.  It''s also dimly lit.  Sorry, but this doesn''t grab me.  Maybe if the cup were smoking or glowing?  3.', '2006-08-24 00:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755298, 382906, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice enough snapshot, although I''d crop out more sky.  And it could be better focused.  I do like the placement of the people and the hillside, but it has utterly no connection to mystery or magic to me.  3.</td>', 'Nice enough snapshot, although I''d crop out more sky.  And it could be better focused.  I do like the placement of the people and the hillside, but it has utterly no connection to mystery or magic to me.  3.', '2006-08-24 01:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755307, 382378, 60862, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the relatively bright lighting and low contrast don''t convey anything mysterious to me about this house.  Now, if one of the windows were glowing, it might.  Or if it were at night, or even darker.<br/> <br/>It''s a nice shot outside of this challenge, though.  4.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the relatively bright lighting and low contrast don''t convey anything mysterious to me about this house.  Now, if one of the windows were glowing, it might.  Or if it were at night, or even darker. It''s a nice shot outside of this challenge, though.  4.', '2006-08-24 01:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755314, 382940, 60862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but to me, the title says "cram this in somehow because I like this shot."  What''s mysterious about the train?  In a free study or a challenge about the sky, I''d give this a 6 or 7, but here, it''s a 4.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but to me, the title says "cram this in somehow because I like this shot."  What''s mysterious about the train?  In a free study or a challenge about the sky, I''d give this a 6 or 7, but here, it''s a 4.', '2006-08-24 01:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755317, 382851, 60862, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting shot, and I like the lighting and composition.<br/> <br/>But I don''t see how it meets the challenge, and even your title doesn''t help.  4.</td>', 'It''s an interesting shot, and I like the lighting and composition. But I don''t see how it meets the challenge, and even your title doesn''t help.  4.', '2006-08-24 01:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755319, 382874, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''m buying the "mystery" part here. :)</td>', 'Not sure I''m buying the "mystery" part here. :)', '2006-08-24 01:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755324, 382830, 45194, '<td valign="top">Interesting paint job for sure...not sure I get the magic and mystery part though</td>', 'Interesting paint job for sure...not sure I get the magic and mystery part though', '2006-08-24 01:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755326, 382972, 60862, '<td valign="top">A dramatic shot, indeed.  And after reading your title, I can see why you''d name it Mordor.  But I don''t get a sense of magic or mystery from the picture without the title.  4.<br/> <br/>I wonder how it''d look with more cropped from the right so the snowy mountain on the left contrasted with the dark rock on the right.</td>', 'A dramatic shot, indeed.  And after reading your title, I can see why you''d name it Mordor.  But I don''t get a sense of magic or mystery from the picture without the title.  4. I wonder how it''d look with more cropped from the right so the snowy mountain on the left contrasted with the dark rock on the right.', '2006-08-24 01:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755330, 383019, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not seeing the magic and mystery in your interpretation</td>', 'Not seeing the magic and mystery in your interpretation', '2006-08-24 01:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755331, 382734, 60862, '<td valign="top">Outside of this challenge, this is a nice B&amp;W landscape.  But it''s DNMC here, so this gets a 4.</td>', 'Outside of this challenge, this is a nice B&W landscape.  But it''s DNMC here, so this gets a 4.', '2006-08-24 01:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755336, 381101, 45194, '<td valign="top">Very pretty sunset...a nice photo for sure...but I think you are stretching to fit a good photo in a challenge where it doesn''t fit.</td>', 'Very pretty sunset...a nice photo for sure...but I think you are stretching to fit a good photo in a challenge where it doesn''t fit.', '2006-08-24 01:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755339, 382944, 60862, '<td valign="top">The fog does add some element of mystery.  However, the dead-center composition misses some of the dramatic potential for me.  Maybe different cropping or a different angle would work better.  4.</td>', 'The fog does add some element of mystery.  However, the dead-center composition misses some of the dramatic potential for me.  Maybe different cropping or a different angle would work better.  4.', '2006-08-24 01:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755341, 382968, 45194, '<td valign="top">Very good shot, particularly because I think it meets the challenge. First 5 or 6 shots I voted on all didn''t really hit the mark.</td>', 'Very good shot, particularly because I think it meets the challenge. First 5 or 6 shots I voted on all didn''t really hit the mark.', '2006-08-24 01:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755342, 382864, 60862, '<td valign="top">This strikes me as a still life, and a decent one at that.  But not mysterious or magical without the title.  Maybe if there were some color swirling in it, or if it were open and smoke were bubbling out?  4.</td>', 'This strikes me as a still life, and a decent one at that.  But not mysterious or magical without the title.  Maybe if there were some color swirling in it, or if it were open and smoke were bubbling out?  4.', '2006-08-24 01:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755343, 382240, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not bad...definately an interesting photo but it doesn''t display a lot of mystery or magic for me.</td>', 'Not bad...definately an interesting photo but it doesn''t display a lot of mystery or magic for me.', '2006-08-24 01:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755344, 383008, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great picture for another challenge.  Not mysterious or magical to me, though. 4.</td>', 'Great picture for another challenge.  Not mysterious or magical to me, though. 4.', '2006-08-24 01:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755347, 382853, 60862, '<td valign="top">A little mysterious because it''s so dark.  But because it''s so dark, I lose most of the emotional reaction.  4.</td>', 'A little mysterious because it''s so dark.  But because it''s so dark, I lose most of the emotional reaction.  4.', '2006-08-24 01:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755349, 382218, 45194, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot...was going to comment that it really didn''t meet the challenge though until I went to describe why I liked it and the word "mystical" came to mind...ok, I''ll say you meet the challenge marginally and have a smoken shot.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot...was going to comment that it really didn''t meet the challenge though until I went to describe why I liked it and the word "mystical" came to mind...ok, I''ll say you meet the challenge marginally and have a smoken shot.', '2006-08-24 01:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755352, 382572, 60862, '<td valign="top">Okay, I get the point.  But the image doesn''t really grab me.  It comes across as more of an accidental double exposure than an illusion.  Maybe it''s because the picture is at such a high angle I can''t see what it is?  Does it relate to the doll somehow?  4.</td>', 'Okay, I get the point.  But the image doesn''t really grab me.  It comes across as more of an accidental double exposure than an illusion.  Maybe it''s because the picture is at such a high angle I can''t see what it is?  Does it relate to the doll somehow?  4.', '2006-08-24 01:10:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2755356, 382251, 45194, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. I''m assuming the "statue" is a live woman imitating a statue.  Inriguing enough to score a 5 though the picture isn''t strong enough for me to score higher unfortunately.  I feel bad because it looks like you put some work into it.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. I''m assuming the "statue" is a live woman imitating a statue.  Inriguing enough to score a 5 though the picture isn''t strong enough for me to score higher unfortunately.  I feel bad because it looks like you put some work into it.', '2006-08-24 01:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755357, 381557, 60862, '<td valign="top">To me, the picture has to carry the story.  The title can add a little extra zing, but can''t move the entire concept into the challenge.  This is an interesting photo, but not making me think of either mystery or magic.<br/> <br/>Her expression is good, the high contrast works well here.  So it''s a good shot outside of this challenge, which from me nets a 4.</td>', 'To me, the picture has to carry the story.  The title can add a little extra zing, but can''t move the entire concept into the challenge.  This is an interesting photo, but not making me think of either mystery or magic. Her expression is good, the high contrast works well here.  So it''s a good shot outside of this challenge, which from me nets a 4.', '2006-08-24 01:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755361, 382127, 60862, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the pic needs to evoke the challenge for me, not the title.  This is a pretty shot, but doesn''t say much magic or mystery to me. 5.</td>', 'Sorry, but the pic needs to evoke the challenge for me, not the title.  This is a pretty shot, but doesn''t say much magic or mystery to me. 5.', '2006-08-24 01:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755363, 383041, 45194, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but not a particularly strong shot for me.  The lighting seems wrong somehow...</td>', 'Meets the challenge but not a particularly strong shot for me.  The lighting seems wrong somehow...', '2006-08-24 01:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755365, 382084, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the picture outside of this challenge.  The flame and its reflection in the melted wax are interesting.  But I get no connection to mystery or magic from the image itself.  I don''t tend to like it when the title carries the connection by itself.  4.</td>', 'I like the picture outside of this challenge.  The flame and its reflection in the melted wax are interesting.  But I get no connection to mystery or magic from the image itself.  I don''t tend to like it when the title carries the connection by itself.  4.', '2006-08-24 01:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755373, 382465, 45194, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this doesn''t portray magic or mystery in my opinion, nor is it a particularly good photo.  Keep your chin up...criticism is hard to take. :)</td>', 'Unfortunately this doesn''t portray magic or mystery in my opinion, nor is it a particularly good photo.  Keep your chin up...criticism is hard to take. :)', '2006-08-24 01:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755374, 381709, 60862, '<td valign="top">Huh.  Never knew perfume is magic.  Unfortunately, I still don''t get the connection.<br/> <br/>Nice photo, though - good lighting, focus, and composition.  It would work work well in an ad challenge,but not here, for me.  4.</td>', 'Huh.  Never knew perfume is magic.  Unfortunately, I still don''t get the connection. Nice photo, though - good lighting, focus, and composition.  It would work work well in an ad challenge,but not here, for me.  4.', '2006-08-24 01:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755377, 382098, 45194, '<td valign="top">Dramatic clouds and nice sillohette...but not really capturing magic and mystery for me.</td>', 'Dramatic clouds and nice sillohette...but not really capturing magic and mystery for me.', '2006-08-24 01:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755381, 382806, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting display, but there are so many sparks I can''t really understand what I''m looking at.  And I don''t get the mystery or magic here.  The composition is a little loose, too - a lot of the water at the bottom could be cropped out to draw the eye more to the ship.<br/> <br/>Outside of this challenge, this might be more interesting, but here, I''m giving it a 3.</td>', 'Interesting display, but there are so many sparks I can''t really understand what I''m looking at.  And I don''t get the mystery or magic here.  The composition is a little loose, too - a lot of the water at the bottom could be cropped out to draw the eye more to the ship. Outside of this challenge, this might be more interesting, but here, I''m giving it a 3.', '2006-08-24 01:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755382, 383042, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea...captured the Mary Poppins feel and this meets the challenge. I give you an above average score for a worthy effort</td>', 'Not a bad idea...captured the Mary Poppins feel and this meets the challenge. I give you an above average score for a worthy effort', '2006-08-24 01:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755384, 382094, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah!  On second viewing, I see the ghost.  Nicely done.  Not much "pop" to it, though, since the colors are so muted and there''s not much contrast.  5.</td>', 'Ah!  On second viewing, I see the ghost.  Nicely done.  Not much "pop" to it, though, since the colors are so muted and there''s not much contrast.  5.', '2006-08-24 01:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
