(2755437, 382572, 45194, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. Not sure I could have pulled it off..but it''s not a particularly strong shot. I think you might have been going for some effect like the doll is walking through the picture but you didn''t quite capture what you were going for. Don''t get discouraged. Keep trying.</td>', 'Interesting effect. Not sure I could have pulled it off..but it''s not a particularly strong shot. I think you might have been going for some effect like the doll is walking through the picture but you didn''t quite capture what you were going for. Don''t get discouraged. Keep trying.', '2006-08-24 01:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755439, 382978, 60862, '<td valign="top">Cute pic, and I like the sharpness in his eye and the overall composition.  But to me this doesn''t meet the challenge.  4.</td>', 'Cute pic, and I like the sharpness in his eye and the overall composition.  But to me this doesn''t meet the challenge.  4.', '2006-08-24 01:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755442, 382719, 60862, '<td valign="top">original comment during the challenge: What hat?  With a hat, it''s a magic trick.  Without it, it''s an attractive bunch of paper (?) butterflies that are unfortunately unconnected to magic or mystery.<br/> <br/>It IS a pretty picture, though, and I would vote it higher in a different, more relevant challenge.  4.<br/> <br/>Followup comment:<br/> <br/>After viewing the shot with a friend, she realized that the dark felt horizontal thing is the hat''s brim.  During the challenge, and until she said that, I thought that was the surface on which the hat was supposed to be resting.<br/> <br/>So - the takeaway here is that viewers don''t always see what we see!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-29 10:37:54.</i></td>', 'original comment during the challenge: What hat?  With a hat, it''s a magic trick.  Without it, it''s an attractive bunch of paper (?) butterflies that are unfortunately unconnected to magic or mystery. It IS a pretty picture, though, and I would vote it higher in a different, more relevant challenge.  4. Followup comment: After viewing the shot with a friend, she realized that the dark felt horizontal thing is the hat''s brim.  During the challenge, and until she said that, I thought that was the surface on which the hat was supposed to be resting. So - the takeaway here is that viewers don''t always see what we see!', '2006-08-24 01:25:49.000000', '2006-08-29 11:37:54.000000', 1),
(2755448, 382884, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but to me this looks like a piece of fabric hanging from a tree, not some entity that''s a bad omen.  I''ll give you credit for the concept, though.  4.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but to me this looks like a piece of fabric hanging from a tree, not some entity that''s a bad omen.  I''ll give you credit for the concept, though.  4.', '2006-08-24 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755451, 382758, 45194, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem to meet the challenge.  If this is a picture of your own child keep in mind that every mother (parent for that matter) tends to think every picture of their child is interesting but for the rest of us they are usually average photos without a lot of interest.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem to meet the challenge.  If this is a picture of your own child keep in mind that every mother (parent for that matter) tends to think every picture of their child is interesting but for the rest of us they are usually average photos without a lot of interest.', '2006-08-24 01:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
