(2755478, 382874, 60862, '<td valign="top">Funny pic.  To me, the mystery is how he''s still standing!<br/> <br/>I think this would''ve been better more tightly cropped around the central bird.  His round shape lends easily to a centered composition and a square crop; in this large rectangle, he''s kind of lost.  And the background, while blurry, still distracts from the central point of the raised leg. Finally, blowing him up more would give more detail in the feathers and his head.  4.</td>', 'Funny pic.  To me, the mystery is how he''s still standing! I think this would''ve been better more tightly cropped around the central bird.  His round shape lends easily to a centered composition and a square crop; in this large rectangle, he''s kind of lost.  And the background, while blurry, still distracts from the central point of the raised leg. Finally, blowing him up more would give more detail in the feathers and his head.  4.', '2006-08-24 01:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
