(2756705, 382950, 8610, '<td valign="top">Realy like this one, good portrait and the elv-eares are awesome, great bokeah. I think the eyes are bit too much in some part, second 9 from me in ths challenge - 9</td>', 'Realy like this one, good portrait and the elv-eares are awesome, great bokeah. I think the eyes are bit too much in some part, second 9 from me in ths challenge - 9', '2006-08-24 12:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2756771, 382603, 62642, '<td valign="top">I love the trees, the coloring, the shadows and light, the bridge is very nice, and that wizard ends up being a distraction for me.  He actually takes away from the magical and mystery elements, at least for me.  Perhaps this is because the magic and mystery is already apparent, and doesn''t seem to need the wizard in control.</td>', 'I love the trees, the coloring, the shadows and light, the bridge is very nice, and that wizard ends up being a distraction for me.  He actually takes away from the magical and mystery elements, at least for me.  Perhaps this is because the magic and mystery is already apparent, and doesn''t seem to need the wizard in control.', '2006-08-24 13:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2756780, 382098, 62642, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and indeed magical.</td>', 'Beautiful and indeed magical.', '2006-08-24 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2756782, 382939, 62642, '<td valign="top">Either a fabulous candid, or those kids are great actors!  I love how some are trying not to be impressed, while others are openly so.  Great contrast too.</td>', 'Either a fabulous candid, or those kids are great actors!  I love how some are trying not to be impressed, while others are openly so.  Great contrast too.', '2006-08-24 13:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
