(2759317, 381543, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is kind of a funny shot, humorous that is.  This could have some potential if the lighting wasn''t so harsh.  Needs to be sharper as well.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is kind of a funny shot, humorous that is.  This could have some potential if the lighting wasn''t so harsh.  Needs to be sharper as well.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 10:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759328, 381722, 30049, '<td valign="top">Something about the composition feels awkward.  I feel like I need to tilt my head sideways to get the correct perspective.  The expression on her face is a bit spacey - zombie looking.  Not sure if that was the impact you were trying to make or not...  The lighting is good overall (prehaps a bit too much shadow on her face), and the image is well focused and sharp.  <br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Something about the composition feels awkward.  I feel like I need to tilt my head sideways to get the correct perspective.  The expression on her face is a bit spacey - zombie looking.  Not sure if that was the impact you were trying to make or not...  The lighting is good overall (prehaps a bit too much shadow on her face), and the image is well focused and sharp.   Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 10:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759347, 382581, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure how this image fits into the challenge theme.  The first thing I think of is ''Loch Ness'' when I see this.  ;^)  The second thing that comes to mind is fuzzy/blurry - is that part of the ''Mystery''?  Hopefully there is something in the photographer''s comments for this that will clarify it some after the challenge is over.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure how this image fits into the challenge theme.  The first thing I think of is ''Loch Ness'' when I see this.  ;^)  The second thing that comes to mind is fuzzy/blurry - is that part of the ''Mystery''?  Hopefully there is something in the photographer''s comments for this that will clarify it some after the challenge is over.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 10:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759351, 383023, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice astronomy shot.  This is one time where the use of Neat Image would be quite applicable (or some other noise reduction software/filter).  Great detail in the moon!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice astronomy shot.  This is one time where the use of Neat Image would be quite applicable (or some other noise reduction software/filter).  Great detail in the moon!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 10:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759356, 381063, 30049, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if the background were more white this image would have more impact.  I''m not getting the ''Magic'' or ''Mystery'' connection.  What is this object?  Looks like a letter opener?  Is there some meaning to the title that I''m missing that tells the viewer what this image is about.  Sorry, not trying to be rude, just really don''t get the approach taken here...<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Perhaps if the background were more white this image would have more impact.  I''m not getting the ''Magic'' or ''Mystery'' connection.  What is this object?  Looks like a letter opener?  Is there some meaning to the title that I''m missing that tells the viewer what this image is about.  Sorry, not trying to be rude, just really don''t get the approach taken here... Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 10:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759367, 383005, 30049, '<td valign="top">Did you mean to say ''Fairy Kiss''?  ;^)  The way this has been processed gives the butterfly a 3D feel, which is cool.  I''m trying to figure out how the tail end of the butterfly has decent details, yet the tips of the wings look blurred or smoothed (noise reduction maybe?).  DOF could be impacting this view as well...hmmm.  I look forward to coming back after the challenge and visiting your comments in the photographers comment section.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Did you mean to say ''Fairy Kiss''?  ;^)  The way this has been processed gives the butterfly a 3D feel, which is cool.  I''m trying to figure out how the tail end of the butterfly has decent details, yet the tips of the wings look blurred or smoothed (noise reduction maybe?).  DOF could be impacting this view as well...hmmm.  I look forward to coming back after the challenge and visiting your comments in the photographers comment section. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 10:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759372, 382858, 60275, '<td valign="top">G, amazing capture. It really fits the challenge in a subtle way. Wish it was a portrait crop to go complement the strong expression. Nevertheless, I love it.</td>', 'G, amazing capture. It really fits the challenge in a subtle way. Wish it was a portrait crop to go complement the strong expression. Nevertheless, I love it.', '2006-08-25 10:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759374, 382635, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  Makes the viewer stop and try to figure it out - which is a good thing.  ;^)  Nice composition and your POV makes this work.  Lighting/exposure is well done for a subject with lighter tones.  The primary point of interest in this for me is the second (smaller) person, rather than the feather as the title implies.  Hope this does well for you.  Good luck!  ;^)</td>', 'Interesting image.  Makes the viewer stop and try to figure it out - which is a good thing.  ;^)  Nice composition and your POV makes this work.  Lighting/exposure is well done for a subject with lighter tones.  The primary point of interest in this for me is the second (smaller) person, rather than the feather as the title implies.  Hope this does well for you.  Good luck!  ;^)', '2006-08-25 10:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759445, 382972, 15204, '<td valign="top">I like the centered composition and the dramatic conversion.  It looks oversharpened to me.  I can see a halo between the dark rocks and the sky.</td>', 'I like the centered composition and the dramatic conversion.  It looks oversharpened to me.  I can see a halo between the dark rocks and the sky.', '2006-08-25 11:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
