(2761758, 382758, 63717, '<td valign="top">this is a pretty good picture</td>', 'this is a pretty good picture', '2006-08-26 06:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2761973, 382687, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is agreat idea and a lovely pic.  I love the softness of the little girl.  Beautifully done.  IMO the background steals some of the potential away from the pic.  It''s dull and the tree is distracting.  Maybe a deeply saturated green backgound?...maybe even next to a little pond would have added a little something to the "fairy tale" feel.  Still very nicely done and so I''m bumping you to 8.</td>', 'This is agreat idea and a lovely pic.  I love the softness of the little girl.  Beautifully done.  IMO the background steals some of the potential away from the pic.  It''s dull and the tree is distracting.  Maybe a deeply saturated green backgound?...maybe even next to a little pond would have added a little something to the "fairy tale" feel.  Still very nicely done and so I''m bumping you to 8.', '2006-08-26 08:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2761975, 382831, 55838, '<td valign="top">Cool, smooth, and creepy.  Bumping to 8.</td>', 'Cool, smooth, and creepy.  Bumping to 8.', '2006-08-26 08:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2761983, 382646, 55838, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  Being a parent is certainly is full of magic &amp; mystery and you captured it well in this pic (right down to the little bit of drool! hee hee).  The love the father has is tangible here.  There is a very light odd circle on the fathers forehead - not sure if that''s a lighting issue but I''m still bumping you to an 8 for a job well done.  Oh - and B&amp;W is perfect here.</td>', 'Beautifully done.  Being a parent is certainly is full of magic & mystery and you captured it well in this pic (right down to the little bit of drool! hee hee).  The love the father has is tangible here.  There is a very light odd circle on the fathers forehead - not sure if that''s a lighting issue but I''m still bumping you to an 8 for a job well done.  Oh - and B&W is perfect here.', '2006-08-26 08:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
