(2762705, 383046, 41200, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully executed illusion! Definitely one of my favorites in the challenge. The only thing that I would want to change is the title. Since it appears to be a spell being cast, I think "Pyromancy" may be more apt. But the image is outstanding. Well done.</td>', 'Wonderfully executed illusion! Definitely one of my favorites in the challenge. The only thing that I would want to change is the title. Since it appears to be a spell being cast, I think "Pyromancy" may be more apt. But the image is outstanding. Well done.', '2006-08-26 15:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
