(2763406, 382858, 62041, '<td valign="top">this photo is perfect: <br/>1. clarity, the photo is so clear, and at the same time, it''s ethereal<br/>2. symmetry and balance <br/>3. focal point: great job on the eyes<br/>4. color variation: highlights in the hair, rosy glow of the skin, the color of the mouth is perfect, the dark brows and eye liner.  <br/>here''s the bonus, the title. how interesting. this is what i get - she is a vampire from salem''s lot/ or her name could be salem. either way, the allusion is not lost.</td>', 'this photo is perfect: 1. clarity, the photo is so clear, and at the same time, it''s ethereal2. symmetry and balance 3. focal point: great job on the eyes4. color variation: highlights in the hair, rosy glow of the skin, the color of the mouth is perfect, the dark brows and eye liner.  here''s the bonus, the title. how interesting. this is what i get - she is a vampire from salem''s lot/ or her name could be salem. either way, the allusion is not lost.', '2006-08-26 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
