(2764550, 382872, 57519, '<td valign="top">The pic is technically good, but the subject (stuffed toys) just doesn''t do it for me.<br/>I do like how your colors turned out though.</td>', 'The pic is technically good, but the subject (stuffed toys) just doesn''t do it for me.I do like how your colors turned out though.', '2006-08-27 15:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764592, 383047, 57936, '<td valign="top">Great humor piece! Love the look in the cat''s eyes!</td>', 'Great humor piece! Love the look in the cat''s eyes!', '2006-08-27 15:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764594, 383008, 57936, '<td valign="top">Great capture! a bit blown out in the center, but the bolts of lightning are wonderful!</td>', 'Great capture! a bit blown out in the center, but the bolts of lightning are wonderful!', '2006-08-27 15:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764597, 382127, 57936, '<td valign="top">The sky is too blown out. Perhaps a gradient filter to tone down the sky without darkenning the watter too much would help.</td>', 'The sky is too blown out. Perhaps a gradient filter to tone down the sky without darkenning the watter too much would help.', '2006-08-27 15:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764598, 382094, 57936, '<td valign="top">Nice effect! I think staying in the frame a touch shorter time would have a better effect, the sheet at the bottom left is a bit too substantial.</td>', 'Nice effect! I think staying in the frame a touch shorter time would have a better effect, the sheet at the bottom left is a bit too substantial.', '2006-08-27 15:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764599, 382855, 57936, '<td valign="top">Well done, but a bit dark.</td>', 'Well done, but a bit dark.', '2006-08-27 15:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764602, 380848, 57936, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image!</td>', 'Very interesting image!', '2006-08-27 15:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764603, 382783, 57936, '<td valign="top">Nice work! Well composed and the ghostly forms add mystery!</td>', 'Nice work! Well composed and the ghostly forms add mystery!', '2006-08-27 15:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764606, 383041, 57936, '<td valign="top">Very well done! The look of concentration on the model''s face is great!</td>', 'Very well done! The look of concentration on the model''s face is great!', '2006-08-27 15:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764612, 383052, 57936, '<td valign="top">This is just great!!!!! I''m dying to know how you did it!!!!!! And you little actors did a great job.</td>', 'This is just great!!!!! I''m dying to know how you did it!!!!!! And you little actors did a great job.', '2006-08-27 15:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764632, 380778, 3214, '<td valign="top">Very pretty high key effect!</td>', 'Very pretty high key effect!', '2006-08-27 16:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764641, 382636, 3214, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection of the blue light on the gloves, and the blue background too.</td>', 'I like the reflection of the blue light on the gloves, and the blue background too.', '2006-08-27 16:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764643, 383007, 3214, '<td valign="top">Powerful image, graphicfunk?  well done.</td>', 'Powerful image, graphicfunk?  well done.', '2006-08-27 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764644, 382810, 3214, '<td valign="top">Powerful shot, but I''m not feeling the magic.  Love the composition, superb.</td>', 'Powerful shot, but I''m not feeling the magic.  Love the composition, superb.', '2006-08-27 16:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764649, 382136, 3214, '<td valign="top">A newt?   "...I got better, but she''s a witch! burn her anyway!"  I bet your model hates the lighting accentuating the bags under her eyes, but it helps make the shot.  If I get to nitpick, I''d like something other than a tank or t shirt, a robe maybe with the sleeves pulled up for a more drapy effect?  Great shot.</td>', 'A newt?   "...I got better, but she''s a witch! burn her anyway!"  I bet your model hates the lighting accentuating the bags under her eyes, but it helps make the shot.  If I get to nitpick, I''d like something other than a tank or t shirt, a robe maybe with the sleeves pulled up for a more drapy effect?  Great shot.', '2006-08-27 16:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764650, 382388, 3214, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.  Super.</td>', 'Simple and effective.  Super.', '2006-08-27 16:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764652, 382982, 3214, '<td valign="top">Probably looks too dark on some peoples'' monitors, but looks good on mine, promotes the sense of mystery.</td>', 'Probably looks too dark on some peoples'' monitors, but looks good on mine, promotes the sense of mystery.', '2006-08-27 16:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764654, 382939, 3214, '<td valign="top">What a nice slice of youthful life!  This shot feels timeless.</td>', 'What a nice slice of youthful life!  This shot feels timeless.', '2006-08-27 16:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764655, 381952, 3214, '<td valign="top">Beautifully shot and processed.  One of my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'Beautifully shot and processed.  One of my favorites this challenge.', '2006-08-27 16:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764656, 382444, 3214, '<td valign="top">Shows up nicely on my display, very intruiging take on levitation.</td>', 'Shows up nicely on my display, very intruiging take on levitation.', '2006-08-27 16:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764657, 382572, 3214, '<td valign="top">Ingenious!  And well shot.</td>', 'Ingenious!  And well shot.', '2006-08-27 16:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764658, 382702, 3214, '<td valign="top">Would love to see a shadowy human form in those interior shadows, but I guess that would be too much to expect, since there''s little chance you know the inhabitants. I like the shot.</td>', 'Would love to see a shadowy human form in those interior shadows, but I guess that would be too much to expect, since there''s little chance you know the inhabitants. I like the shot.', '2006-08-27 16:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764663, 383047, 3214, '<td valign="top">Clever.  And I like the negative space for the bunny, uh, kitty to pop up into.</td>', 'Clever.  And I like the negative space for the bunny, uh, kitty to pop up into.', '2006-08-27 16:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764665, 382748, 3214, '<td valign="top">Spectacularly simple and compelling!</td>', 'Spectacularly simple and compelling!', '2006-08-27 16:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764666, 382991, 3214, '<td valign="top">LOVE it!  Nice depth of field, too, to intensify our interest in the doomed lovers.  Realizing it isn''t everyone''s cup of tea, but as one of the mysteries of life, death is worth the exploration.</td>', 'LOVE it!  Nice depth of field, too, to intensify our interest in the doomed lovers.  Realizing it isn''t everyone''s cup of tea, but as one of the mysteries of life, death is worth the exploration.', '2006-08-27 16:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764667, 382884, 3214, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, the figure of a man?  It''s dark enough that I am imagining what is in the center/top of the screen to maybe NOT be a clump of leaves.  Otherwise, the dark vignette works.</td>', 'Hmmmm, the figure of a man?  It''s dark enough that I am imagining what is in the center/top of the screen to maybe NOT be a clump of leaves.  Otherwise, the dark vignette works.', '2006-08-27 16:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764670, 382470, 3214, '<td valign="top">What a natural for this challenge!</td>', 'What a natural for this challenge!', '2006-08-27 16:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764671, 382720, 3214, '<td valign="top">Love the tight framing and rich tones!</td>', 'Love the tight framing and rich tones!', '2006-08-27 16:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764673, 382906, 3214, '<td valign="top">Good raw material, maybe explore the use of curves to get some pop?</td>', 'Good raw material, maybe explore the use of curves to get some pop?', '2006-08-27 16:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764675, 382864, 3214, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective, painterly even. 7</td>', 'Simple and effective, painterly even. 7', '2006-08-27 16:31:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2764677, 381612, 3214, '<td valign="top">Great toning.</td>', 'Great toning.', '2006-08-27 16:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764678, 382903, 3214, '<td valign="top">IR?  If only you''d submitted it bigger, 640 on the long side...</td>', 'IR?  If only you''d submitted it bigger, 640 on the long side...', '2006-08-27 16:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764681, 383042, 3214, '<td valign="top">Need some negative space beneath her feet to heighten the impression of flying...just my $.02.  Grand concept.</td>', 'Need some negative space beneath her feet to heighten the impression of flying...just my $.02.  Grand concept.', '2006-08-27 16:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764683, 382218, 3214, '<td valign="top">Lots to explore here, neat shot.</td>', 'Lots to explore here, neat shot.', '2006-08-27 16:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764685, 382804, 3214, '<td valign="top">Nice job turning back the clock, the lighting even feels retro.</td>', 'Nice job turning back the clock, the lighting even feels retro.', '2006-08-27 16:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764689, 381724, 3214, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, as a unicorn fan, his horn is misplaced, should be on the forehead instead of on the poll, and angled out more forward than up. &lt;g&gt;  Nice concept.  I''d prefer more sharpness to better delineate the silhouette.</td>', 'Hmmm, as a unicorn fan, his horn is misplaced, should be on the forehead instead of on the poll, and angled out more forward than up. <g>  Nice concept.  I''d prefer more sharpness to better delineate the silhouette.', '2006-08-27 16:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764692, 382878, 3214, '<td valign="top">Terrific!  Especially choosing to shoot from below, with the moon over "his" shoulder.</td>', 'Terrific!  Especially choosing to shoot from below, with the moon over "his" shoulder.', '2006-08-27 16:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764708, 382831, 31230, '<td valign="top">Very nice mood.</td>', 'Very nice mood.', '2006-08-27 16:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764709, 383040, 3214, '<td valign="top">Best ghostly shot so far!</td>', 'Best ghostly shot so far!', '2006-08-27 16:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764710, 382581, 31230, '<td valign="top">Its really blurry.  Not sure if that was your intention.</td>', 'Its really blurry.  Not sure if that was your intention.', '2006-08-27 16:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764712, 383008, 3214, '<td valign="top">I like the low key and toning.</td>', 'I like the low key and toning.', '2006-08-27 16:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764713, 383046, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I hope you tell how you did this.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Nice.  I hope you tell how you did this.  Very nicely done.', '2006-08-27 16:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764714, 383040, 31230, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the window reflection to create the illusion.</td>', 'Interesting use of the window reflection to create the illusion.', '2006-08-27 16:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764715, 382930, 3214, '<td valign="top">I like it--just otherworldly enough, and the lack of a human is good.</td>', 'I like it--just otherworldly enough, and the lack of a human is good.', '2006-08-27 16:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764716, 382971, 31230, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, these eyes are amazing.  Reminds me of the Howling.</td>', 'Oh wow, these eyes are amazing.  Reminds me of the Howling.', '2006-08-27 16:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764749, 383048, 3214, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and otherworldly--excellent!</td>', 'Beautiful and otherworldly--excellent!', '2006-08-27 17:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764752, 383019, 3214, '<td valign="top">great subject--now as to the technicals. &lt;g&gt;  A gradient adjustment layer to bring some color/definition back into your image, from teh top down?</td>', 'great subject--now as to the technicals. <g>  A gradient adjustment layer to bring some color/definition back into your image, from teh top down?', '2006-08-27 17:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764756, 381445, 3214, '<td valign="top">LOL, thanks for the humor.</td>', 'LOL, thanks for the humor.', '2006-08-27 17:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764782, 382950, 25397, '<td valign="top">Nice one Mistah Sig</td>', 'Nice one Mistah Sig', '2006-08-27 17:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764861, 382830, 39880, '<td valign="top">What a great portrait.  I like the lighting and the colors.  Well done.</td>', 'What a great portrait.  I like the lighting and the colors.  Well done.', '2006-08-27 18:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764970, 383046, 56978, '<td valign="top">Very impressive...I look forward to reading how it was done!</td>', 'Very impressive...I look forward to reading how it was done!', '2006-08-27 19:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765009, 382930, 61379, '<td valign="top">very very nice! great work. this photo comes at you, if it doesn''t check your pulse!...10</td>', 'very very nice! great work. this photo comes at you, if it doesn''t check your pulse!...10', '2006-08-27 20:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765096, 382906, 30861, '<td valign="top">It is certainly a place of magic &amp; mystery; I remember it well, from the late 50''s. It is unfortunate that the weather was not more cooperative for you. I am left with the feeling that the square composition is not doing this justice, as well; I feel the need to see the estuary, the sweep of the low horizon, on the left. Even so, the image works well for me.</td>', 'It is certainly a place of magic & mystery; I remember it well, from the late 50''s. It is unfortunate that the weather was not more cooperative for you. I am left with the feeling that the square composition is not doing this justice, as well; I feel the need to see the estuary, the sweep of the low horizon, on the left. Even so, the image works well for me.', '2006-08-27 21:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765177, 382635, 30861, '<td valign="top">My top pick. I find this totally whimsical and engaging. Good luck!</td>', 'My top pick. I find this totally whimsical and engaging. Good luck!', '2006-08-27 21:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765181, 382939, 30861, '<td valign="top">I think this is completely terrific! Majorly amusing. The way the poiting kid''s face is turned from the rope even as he points to it is fantastic. Good luck!</td>', 'I think this is completely terrific! Majorly amusing. The way the poiting kid''s face is turned from the rope even as he points to it is fantastic. Good luck!', '2006-08-27 21:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765185, 382950, 52628, '<td valign="top">Wow, the best image in the competition!</td>', 'Wow, the best image in the competition!', '2006-08-27 21:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765186, 382722, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, slightly marred by the bright blue boat, which I wish you had selected and desaturated a fair amount so it wasn''t such an eyetrap.</td>', 'Lovely scene, slightly marred by the bright blue boat, which I wish you had selected and desaturated a fair amount so it wasn''t such an eyetrap.', '2006-08-27 21:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765191, 383052, 30861, '<td valign="top">Terrific concept, great "How was THAT done?" material. Marred by lackluster technicals and drab surrounding colors, plus extreme blowout on the face of the levitating child.</td>', 'Terrific concept, great "How was THAT done?" material. Marred by lackluster technicals and drab surrounding colors, plus extreme blowout on the face of the levitating child.', '2006-08-27 21:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765193, 382431, 30861, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites int he challenge. WEIRD architecture.</td>', 'One of my favorites int he challenge. WEIRD architecture.', '2006-08-27 21:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765198, 383040, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, very moody and evocative.</td>', 'This is very nice, very moody and evocative.', '2006-08-27 21:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765199, 382950, 31230, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  She looks like an elf from Rivendale.</td>', 'Excellent.  She looks like an elf from Rivendale.', '2006-08-27 21:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765204, 383042, 55838, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Great idea.  Perfect color tones and crop.<br/>***********<br/>Back to bump up Poppins.  I like this.  Bye bye 7, hello 8.</td>', 'Well done.  Great idea.  Perfect color tones and crop.***********Back to bump up Poppins.  I like this.  Bye bye 7, hello 8.', '2006-08-27 21:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765208, 382930, 31230, '<td valign="top">Spooky</td>', 'Spooky', '2006-08-27 21:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765209, 381952, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s potentially a truly wonderful shot, but the lighting and the extreme coloring both seem off to me. The magenta fingertips, the strange color of the eraser, plus what appears to be the shadow of the pencil down the middle of her face hurt this image in my eyes. A 7 from me nevertheless.</td>', 'It''s potentially a truly wonderful shot, but the lighting and the extreme coloring both seem off to me. The magenta fingertips, the strange color of the eraser, plus what appears to be the shadow of the pencil down the middle of her face hurt this image in my eyes. A 7 from me nevertheless.', '2006-08-27 21:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765212, 382878, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nicely and dramatically done.</td>', 'Nicely and dramatically done.', '2006-08-27 21:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765279, 382874, 8610, '<td valign="top">lol.... funny shit</td>', 'lol.... funny shit', '2006-08-27 21:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765289, 382878, 8610, '<td valign="top">Realy like this one, great take on the challange. First 9 from me in the challenge. Hope to see this one in top 5</td>', 'Realy like this one, great take on the challange. First 9 from me in the challenge. Hope to see this one in top 5', '2006-08-27 21:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765294, 382603, 8610, '<td valign="top">great idea,, too soft look</td>', 'great idea,, too soft look', '2006-08-27 22:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765295, 382807, 49315, '<td valign="top">This will do well...</td>', 'This will do well...', '2006-08-27 22:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765310, 383046, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is fun! I like the expert handling of light here, as well as the groovy flames!</td>', 'This is fun! I like the expert handling of light here, as well as the groovy flames!', '2006-08-27 22:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765345, 383046, 44453, '<td valign="top">one of the most visually simple yet dramatic photos in this challenge - I hope this is top ten.</td>', 'one of the most visually simple yet dramatic photos in this challenge - I hope this is top ten.', '2006-08-27 22:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765354, 382878, 44453, '<td valign="top">very good - I like the angle you''e taken this from, makes the skull seem very ominous and dominating, even scary</td>', 'very good - I like the angle you''e taken this from, makes the skull seem very ominous and dominating, even scary', '2006-08-27 22:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765357, 382831, 44453, '<td valign="top">I like this look, just wish you had less sky in the photo.  its a a real waste of the top third of the photo.</td>', 'I like this look, just wish you had less sky in the photo.  its a a real waste of the top third of the photo.', '2006-08-27 22:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765361, 382444, 44453, '<td valign="top">very nice low key processing, with the 3 white highlights, very effective - 9</td>', 'very nice low key processing, with the 3 white highlights, very effective - 9', '2006-08-27 22:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765369, 383007, 44453, '<td valign="top">very very cool - I have some idea how you did this but to be able to pull it off so well is amazing. Top 10 for sure!</td>', 'very very cool - I have some idea how you did this but to be able to pull it off so well is amazing. Top 10 for sure!', '2006-08-27 22:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765387, 382950, 44453, '<td valign="top">top ten for sure  - love the ears!!</td>', 'top ten for sure  - love the ears!!', '2006-08-27 22:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
