(2765401, 382992, 23258, '<td valign="top">Hey! I see we have a clevelander. :)I love hanging out here.. it''s so pretty in the fall with all the beautiful trees.</td>', 'Hey! I see we have a clevelander. :)I love hanging out here.. it''s so pretty in the fall with all the beautiful trees.', '2006-08-27 22:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765403, 383053, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice control of lighting and a very interesting subject. 8</td>', 'Nice control of lighting and a very interesting subject. 8', '2006-08-27 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765407, 381823, 33672, '<td valign="top">Masterful job. Great control of the subject and lighting and comp. My guess is it''ll Ribbon. Good luck</td>', 'Masterful job. Great control of the subject and lighting and comp. My guess is it''ll Ribbon. Good luck', '2006-08-27 22:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765410, 383039, 33672, '<td valign="top">Funny... But needs more contrast.</td>', 'Funny... But needs more contrast.', '2006-08-27 22:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765411, 382722, 44453, '<td valign="top">beautiful landscape, I''m not sure about the centered composition, but not sure how it could be improved either.</td>', 'beautiful landscape, I''m not sure about the centered composition, but not sure how it could be improved either.', '2006-08-27 22:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765423, 382956, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the subject as well as the comp. However, its obvious that you blurred the background in PP. (I know because I do the same to create a false DOF that is impossible to get with a Point and Shoot.) The problem here is that it''s inconsistant on this photo.There a spot between the performers leg and the ladder that is sharper even though it shouldn''t be. The woman watching too. Good luck and this is only my humble opinion.</td>', 'I like the idea and the subject as well as the comp. However, its obvious that you blurred the background in PP. (I know because I do the same to create a false DOF that is impossible to get with a Point and Shoot.) The problem here is that it''s inconsistant on this photo.There a spot between the performers leg and the ladder that is sharper even though it shouldn''t be. The woman watching too. Good luck and this is only my humble opinion.', '2006-08-27 23:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765447, 382603, 44453, '<td valign="top">I like this even more now that I come back for a second viewing - maybe a little too much with the yellow and green?</td>', 'I like this even more now that I come back for a second viewing - maybe a little too much with the yellow and green?', '2006-08-27 23:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765463, 381835, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution. Comp and use of negative space are great too.</td>', 'Great idea and execution. Comp and use of negative space are great too.', '2006-08-27 23:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765465, 382667, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love the tones and the comp. Face seems to have a bit too much NI. Maybe its my monitor.</td>', 'I love the tones and the comp. Face seems to have a bit too much NI. Maybe its my monitor.', '2006-08-27 23:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765467, 381445, 33672, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh and wonder if the center part is elastic or a spring (Slinky?)</td>', 'Made me laugh and wonder if the center part is elastic or a spring (Slinky?)', '2006-08-27 23:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765468, 382444, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and texture.</td>', 'Nice lighting and texture.', '2006-08-27 23:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
