(2766862, 382758, 53147, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lkn4truth:</b></div><hr/><i>If this is a picture of your own child keep in mind that every mother (parent for that matter) tends to think every picture of their child is interesting but for the rest of us they are usually average photos without a lot of interest. </i></td></tr></table> Well except for those two guys who labeled this as a fav and the 52 people who voted it a 7 or above. Oh yeah and no 1s or 2s to boot. Rocking picture woman! We shall keep this one in view FOREVER!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by lkn4truth:If this is a picture of your own child keep in mind that every mother (parent for that matter) tends to think every picture of their child is interesting but for the rest of us they are usually average photos without a lot of interest.  Well except for those two guys who labeled this as a fav and the 52 people who voted it a 7 or above. Oh yeah and no 1s or 2s to boot. Rocking picture woman! We shall keep this one in view FOREVER!!!', '2006-08-28 06:52:06.000000', NULL, 0),
