(2766866, 383044, 53147, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 7 on this shot. I actually liked it alot. May have not been a perfect fit challenge wise but it is a good composition. Theboat is framed in nicely by the funky clouds and the surf. The surf might be a bit blown out but not a biggie here. The colors are pleasingly odd (in a small way odd) and the NI works well on this one. I think you were robbed here.</td>', 'I gave you a 7 on this shot. I actually liked it alot. May have not been a perfect fit challenge wise but it is a good composition. Theboat is framed in nicely by the funky clouds and the surf. The surf might be a bit blown out but not a biggie here. The colors are pleasingly odd (in a small way odd) and the NI works well on this one. I think you were robbed here.', '2006-08-28 06:57:44.000000', NULL, 0),
