(2778744, 382470, 32321, '<td valign="top">Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>First Impression:<br/>Nice shot. My eyes were drawn to the bright green and then the white light. Back to the green, back to the white before I was able to see the rest of the detail. The white light really competes for attention.<br/> <br/>Composition:<br/>Really nice composition. I like the lines created by the northern lights, the far shore and the beach. Nice boat placement as well.<br/> <br/>Subject:<br/>Meets challenge<br/> <br/>Technical:<br/>Since this is an advanced editing challenge, I would have toned down the white light and its two reflections, (Boat and shore). Make it more identifiable as to what it is, without creating blown white areas. I think that change would really draw out the rest of the detail, the stars and colours.<br/>You could have submitted a larger file. Your 128k, 600 X 400 file limits the view size and detail we see. Try to get to the 150k, 640 X size allowed<br/> <br/>Summary:<br/>Congratulations on your best score! Nice to see your scores improving.<br/>Good luck in future challenges<br/></td>', 'Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club. First Impression:Nice shot. My eyes were drawn to the bright green and then the white light. Back to the green, back to the white before I was able to see the rest of the detail. The white light really competes for attention. Composition:Really nice composition. I like the lines created by the northern lights, the far shore and the beach. Nice boat placement as well. Subject:Meets challenge Technical:Since this is an advanced editing challenge, I would have toned down the white light and its two reflections, (Boat and shore). Make it more identifiable as to what it is, without creating blown white areas. I think that change would really draw out the rest of the detail, the stars and colours.You could have submitted a larger file. Your 128k, 600 X 400 file limits the view size and detail we see. Try to get to the 150k, 640 X size allowed Summary:Congratulations on your best score! Nice to see your scores improving.Good luck in future challenges', '2006-08-31 14:02:19.000000', NULL, 0),
