(2797562, 381445, 37858, '<td valign="top">You are definitely on a roll...another clever photo.  I''m not sure how you managed to get such clarity with the tigers and the tree trunk (given the dark lair and lighter tree) using f/5.8 (I would have thought DoF would blur the tree) but you have clearly accomplished a super photo under difficult lighting conditions.</td>', 'You are definitely on a roll...another clever photo.  I''m not sure how you managed to get such clarity with the tigers and the tree trunk (given the dark lair and lighter tree) using f/5.8 (I would have thought DoF would blur the tree) but you have clearly accomplished a super photo under difficult lighting conditions.', '2006-09-04 18:41:28.000000', NULL, 0),
