(2863500, 382557, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done dandelion shot. I think all living things are God''s mysteries. The whole idea of life is so amazing and wonderful. We are made out of the same ingredients as rocks and dirt yet we are alive - thinking about it always amazes me. Even something as simple as this dandelion - it was one life and now with all the seeds ready to blow off it has the potential to be MANY lives again. By dying it will be reborn many times. Whenever I start thinking about stuff like this I start to wax philosophical!</td>', 'Very nicely done dandelion shot. I think all living things are God''s mysteries. The whole idea of life is so amazing and wonderful. We are made out of the same ingredients as rocks and dirt yet we are alive - thinking about it always amazes me. Even something as simple as this dandelion - it was one life and now with all the seeds ready to blow off it has the potential to be MANY lives again. By dying it will be reborn many times. Whenever I start thinking about stuff like this I start to wax philosophical!', '2006-09-25 14:54:12.000000', NULL, 0),
